If you're playing without the 'HARD' option compiled in,
spellbooks are good for an infinite number of uses as long as
you've got the power points and food to keep chanting them.
So a spellbook of extra healing can make you into an appallingly
tough character, and the only way to be killed is to do something
stupid like drowning or trying to stare down Medusa.
I've taken healers up to 300-400 HP this way.
(And gotten them killed off anyway :-)

